Loop,   LoadI Start
        SkipCond 800
        Jump End
        Output
        Load Start
        Add One
        Store Start
        Jump Loop
End,    Halt


Start, Adr String
String, Hex 57 /W
        Hex 41 /A
        Hex 4E /N
        Hex 53 /S
        Hex 55 /U
        Hex 46 /F
        Hex 45 /E
        Hex 49 /I
        Hex 0  /end of string
One,    Dec 1  /1